			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Ranjit"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 746820101,
					"content": "So we're here in the end...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820102,
					"content": "What about your childhood dream?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 746820103,
					"content": "When I became an adult, I finally understood why the Forest Watchers had made those faces they did...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820104,
					"content": "*cough* But anyway, I gave it my best shot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820105,
					"content": "I also learned that you should never bring unprocessed Pyro Regisvine fruit near a Jadeplume Terrorshroom...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820106,
					"content": "By the time I smelled something burning, it was already too late. Barely avoided drowning in the spores it poured forth.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820107,
					"content": "It's easy to forget, sometimes, that Fungi are a completely different species from Shroomboars.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820108,
					"content": "Anyway, speaking of which, they actually are a type of fungus, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820109,
					"content": "That's right, and they taste especially delicious in soups.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820110,
					"content": "But anyway, let's get back to today's challenge.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820111,
					"content": "Well, I haven't figured out what to cook ye... Oh! Right, uh, you mean the \"negotiations.\" Sorry.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820112,
					"content": "Perhaps you've heard the story of the two Fontemer Aberrant overlords? It speaks of how the Millennial Pearl Seahorse is described as being \"proud\" and \"noble.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820113,
					"content": "By contrast, the Emperor of Fire and Iron seems to be a fierce, cruel being, strong but brutal.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820114,
					"content": "And here Paimon thought you'd pick the tougher opponent. After all, wouldn't a stronger opponent make for a cooler story?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820115,
					"content": "That is true, but the Emperor is a heavily-armored crab... While the other party's a seahorse that flies!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820116,
						746820118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820116,
					"content": "I wonder, would you call a flying seahorse a Pegasus instead?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 746820117,
					"content": "Wait, is that the question we should be asking right now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820119,
					"content": "Still, if I could only ride it, even once...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820120,
					"content": "Well, sure then. Looks like you're sticking this one out to the end.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820121,
					"content": "Well, we are here, aren't we? Surely we can't leave empty-handed? Anyway, let's head out once you're ready.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820122,
						746820123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820122,
					"content": "I'm ready.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 746820123,
					"content": "I've got other things to handle. See you in a bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 746820124,
					"content": "No worries. I'll wait for you here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 746820118,
					"content": "Makes no difference to me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						746820119
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}